WEBVTT

00:01.710 --> 00:04.040
Man, I can't believe this day has finally come...

00:04.500 --> 00:07.500
Come on, baby. It's all riding on you!

00:14.580 --> 00:15.790
<b>SMASH!</b>

00:18.750 --> 00:20.880
Yeah... this should be enough.

00:21.920 --> 00:23.130
I can afford it.

00:23.710 --> 00:25.790
I'm so close to wearing that sailor uniform.

00:25.790 --> 00:27.790
I just need one more thing!

00:28.000 --> 00:29.580
It's time to buy...

00:29.580 --> 00:31.920
MY OWN BRA!

00:33.000 --> 00:35.000
<b>A Chest Full of Longing!!</b>

00:35.790 --> 00:39.880
Trapped in an endless pitfall of love and crazy about you

00:39.880 --> 00:42.630
Don't let your eyes wander darling, that's a no-no

00:42.630 --> 00:45.960
Pain pain, fly away, until only love remains

00:45.960 --> 00:48.750
My heart is stirring with affection

01:00.000 --> 01:03.000
I hate being alone, just a touch is enough

01:03.000 --> 01:06.040
To be connected y'know, it's a nice feeling y'know

01:06.040 --> 01:09.080
The negative opinions of others don't matter

01:09.080 --> 01:12.170
Like the saying goes, love is blind

01:12.170 --> 01:15.830
I will never have the ultimate fashion sense

01:15.830 --> 01:19.210
Is it envy? Or misery? In this story

01:19.210 --> 01:21.880
Feelings communicated in mentions

01:21.880 --> 01:25.880
C'mon, I want it communicated in words

01:25.880 --> 01:30.000
Trapped in an endless pitfall of love and crazy about you

01:30.000 --> 01:32.670
Don't let your eyes wander darling, that's a no-no

01:32.670 --> 01:36.130
Pain pain, fly away, until only love remains

01:36.130 --> 01:38.500
Although it's also stressful

01:38.500 --> 01:41.710
Cheating and drowning in dreams

01:41.710 --> 01:45.000
There's no realistic romance anymore

01:45.210 --> 01:48.290
Trapped in a pitfall of love and crazy about you

01:48.290 --> 01:51.000
My heart is stirring with affection

01:51.210 --> 01:52.790
La la la la la

01:52.790 --> 01:54.250
Compulsive, I need you

01:54.250 --> 01:55.920
La la la la la

01:55.920 --> 01:57.250
Loneliness is a disease

01:57.250 --> 01:58.880
La la la la la

01:58.880 --> 02:00.420
Blind, I need you

02:00.420 --> 02:03.330
Now and forever, I wanna be crazy about you

02:07.250 --> 02:09.880
I had to stay at school so late for cleaning duty...

02:16.330 --> 02:18.080
Guess I was just hearing things.

02:26.330 --> 02:27.080
Who's there?!

02:31.170 --> 02:32.380
This is weird.

02:38.750 --> 02:39.500
Hey!

02:39.500 --> 02:40.830
What's the big id-

02:40.830 --> 02:41.670
Clatter!

02:42.330 --> 02:43.580
Major creep alert!

02:44.500 --> 02:45.380
Dammit!

02:45.380 --> 02:46.380
She caught on to us!

02:46.380 --> 02:47.790
Stay on her tail and keep a low profile!

02:47.790 --> 02:48.460
Right!

02:48.460 --> 02:50.210
<b>RUSTLE</b>

02:48.460 --> 02:50.210
<b>CLATTER</b>

02:48.460 --> 02:50.210
<b>WOOF</b>

02:50.420 --> 02:51.920
Oh god! They're chasing me!

02:53.250 --> 02:54.380
Ryunosuke!

02:56.130 --> 02:57.500
Oy!

02:57.500 --> 02:58.960
What do you think you're doing?!

02:58.960 --> 03:00.540
I need to go the other way
so that I can get ho-

03:00.540 --> 03:02.580
Please! Just stay with me like this
for a few minutes!

03:03.290 --> 03:06.000
C-crap. Who is that dude?

03:06.000 --> 03:08.080
She's hanging on to his arm while they walk!

03:08.080 --> 03:10.000
Must be her boyfriend or something.

03:10.000 --> 03:11.920
A bunch of creepos are stalking me.

03:11.920 --> 03:13.420
Will you help me get rid of them?

03:14.710 --> 03:18.250
Sorry to disappoint, but I'm not
in a fighting mood right now.

03:18.250 --> 03:19.460
Why's that?

03:19.460 --> 03:21.830
Actually, I just noticed you seem
kinda down in the dumps.

03:22.420 --> 03:24.880
Yeah... so the thing is...

03:26.420 --> 03:28.330
I had high hopes for today.

03:28.330 --> 03:31.250
It was supposed to be the last time
I wore this stupid chest binding wrap.

03:31.250 --> 03:34.830
So I marched my way into
the lingerie shop happy as a clam.

03:35.500 --> 03:36.750
Welcome in.

03:37.750 --> 03:40.630
B-b-b-b-bra...

03:41.000 --> 03:42.630
I would like to buy a bra please!

03:43.170 --> 03:44.630
Uh, sure.

03:45.420 --> 03:46.960
This one is 2,000 yen.

03:46.960 --> 03:48.420
This one is 3,000 yen.

03:48.420 --> 03:50.170
And this one here is 5,000 yen.

03:50.500 --> 03:54.380
D-d-d-did... you say five THOUSAND?!

03:54.380 --> 03:55.210
Yes...

03:56.250 --> 03:57.790
Dammit to hell!

03:57.790 --> 04:01.880
Nobody told me bras were a friggin'
luxury item that cost an arm and a leg!

04:02.080 --> 04:03.630
How much money do you have?

04:03.630 --> 04:05.130
Good question.

04:05.880 --> 04:07.830
About 400 yen or so.

04:07.830 --> 04:09.130
I thought that was a lot.

04:12.250 --> 04:14.750
B-but shucks, guess I'm gonna need more!

04:14.750 --> 04:16.250
Uh, yeah...

04:16.250 --> 04:19.750
Maybe with 100 more you could afford
a bra from the bargain bin.

04:19.750 --> 04:22.170
A-another 100 yen, huh?

04:22.170 --> 04:23.460
That's a bummer!

04:26.500 --> 04:28.290
They're having a good time and laughing it up!

04:28.290 --> 04:29.290
Go figure.

04:29.290 --> 04:30.630
I've seen enough.

04:30.630 --> 04:32.250
Guess I need a new plan.

04:32.250 --> 04:33.330
Good luck.

04:33.330 --> 04:34.540
Stop right there!

04:35.250 --> 04:40.710
<b>Dog</b>

04:35.580 --> 04:37.170
Hey, buttwipes...

04:37.170 --> 04:39.830
Cut it out with the damn flirting already!

04:39.830 --> 04:40.710
Woof!

04:41.500 --> 04:43.040
Who the hell are you punks?

04:43.330 --> 04:46.330
We're students from Butsumetsu High
just across the way.

04:47.040 --> 04:49.420
And you must be Shinobu Miyake, that right?

04:49.420 --> 04:52.000
Y-yeah, I am!
What's it got to do with you?!

04:52.000 --> 04:53.880
We got this bossman in our gang, ya see...

04:53.880 --> 04:56.540
and he's very much interested
in going out with you.

04:56.710 --> 04:58.750
B-bossman?

04:59.130 --> 05:00.540
Well, I'm not into hoodlums!

05:01.000 --> 05:03.000
Aw crap, you don't gotta be
that blunt about it!

05:03.000 --> 05:04.170
Hey, dude!

05:04.170 --> 05:06.920
Do us a favor and just break up
with Shinobu right here and now!

05:06.920 --> 05:07.880
Say what?

05:07.880 --> 05:10.250
Why the hell should we break up
just cuz you asked?

05:11.380 --> 05:12.670
He's got a point.

05:12.670 --> 05:13.830
I hate to admit it,

05:13.830 --> 05:17.580
but we got no business trying to tell
a perfectly happy couple to call it quits.

05:17.580 --> 05:19.330
C-c-c-couple?!

05:19.460 --> 05:21.000
Who the hell are you callin' a couple?!

05:21.250 --> 05:22.880
I'M A WOMAN, DAMMIT!

05:21.250 --> 05:23.920
<b>BIFF!</b>

05:22.880 --> 05:23.920
Whaaaaaaaat?!

05:24.130 --> 05:25.500
Well, it ain't unheard of.

05:25.500 --> 05:27.290
Everybody's got their own way of livin'.

05:27.290 --> 05:28.880
But what are we gonna do now?

05:28.880 --> 05:31.460
Hey! What're you murmuring about over there?
Dealing with the bossman isn't gonna be easy...<b></b>

05:31.750 --> 05:35.210
Here's the deal. To be totally honest,
we're up shit creek right now.

05:35.210 --> 05:37.500
Our bossman is persistent as hell!

05:37.500 --> 05:40.330
He's so desperate to date Shinobu
that he'd rather die than give up on her.

05:40.330 --> 05:41.330
Wow!

05:41.960 --> 05:45.040
W-well, maybe dating someone
who's that passionate isn't so bad.

05:45.040 --> 05:46.500
Even though I'm not into hoodlums.

05:46.670 --> 05:48.830
By the way, here's a picture of our bossman.

05:49.750 --> 05:51.080
N-n-no freaking way!

05:51.080 --> 05:52.210
Let's get out of here!

05:52.210 --> 05:53.290
Uh, okay.

05:54.130 --> 05:55.130
Just wait a sec!

05:55.500 --> 05:57.830
Maybe we can solve this problem together...

05:57.830 --> 05:59.500
What does that mean?

06:00.000 --> 06:01.960
<b>Butsumetsu High School</b>

06:00.000 --> 06:01.960
<b>The Bossman's Hangout</b>

06:02.250 --> 06:04.920
I LOVE SHINOBUUUUUU!

06:05.170 --> 06:06.920
Love! Love!

06:06.920 --> 06:08.750
I love you, babyyyyyy!

06:08.750 --> 06:10.880
Please bossman!
Cool your jets for a second!

06:10.880 --> 06:14.290
I know it's hard to accept,
but Shinobu already has a boyfriend.

06:14.290 --> 06:17.330
So listen, we'll go out and
snap a bunch of pics of them for you.

06:17.330 --> 06:20.540
And once you see the cold hard evidence,
you gotta agree to let her go!

06:20.540 --> 06:21.750
Shinobu, my loooooooooove!

06:21.750 --> 06:22.830
Hey Bossman! Are you listening to us?!
Shinobu, my loooooooooove!<b></b>

06:22.830 --> 06:24.380
Hey Bossman! Are you listening to us?!

06:25.380 --> 06:27.380
WHAT?!

06:27.380 --> 06:30.580
Shinobu and Ryunosuke are
going out on a date?!

06:30.580 --> 06:33.210
But why?! How on earth did this happen?!

06:33.210 --> 06:35.380
Well, we didn't have much of a choice.

06:35.380 --> 06:37.580
These guys from Butsumetsu High said...

06:38.000 --> 06:40.080
We'll follow you gals around
while you go on a date

06:40.080 --> 06:42.460
and take a ton of photos
to show our bossman!

06:42.460 --> 06:45.000
Seeing that should convince him
to call it quits!

06:46.330 --> 06:47.460
That's the deal.

06:47.460 --> 06:50.580
Why did you agree? I thought you hated
being treated like a guy!

06:50.580 --> 06:53.080
Look, I've got my own needs to consider.

06:53.080 --> 06:54.540
And I feel better with Ryunosuke,

06:54.540 --> 06:56.210
since I don't have to worry about
any funny business!

06:56.210 --> 06:57.580
You've gotta be kidding me!

06:57.580 --> 06:58.460
Shinobu!

06:58.460 --> 07:01.420
Just do the sensible thing and go out
with me instead! There's still time!

07:01.420 --> 07:02.500
Think this over carefully!

07:02.500 --> 07:07.000
Let me be your date! Please!
Darling! You stop that right now, mister!<b></b>

07:07.000 --> 07:10.500
Well, I ain't playing
the role of boyfriend for free...

07:10.670 --> 07:11.580
C'mon, Shinobu!

07:11.960 --> 07:14.380
Radical! The weather couldn't be any better.

07:14.380 --> 07:15.790
Alrighty, Ryunosuke!

07:15.790 --> 07:19.330
This gift certificate here will be all yours
to take once the date is over!

07:19.330 --> 07:22.040
G-good! You better hold up
your end of the bargain!

07:23.000 --> 07:25.460
Okay. For starters,
let's see you walk arm-in-arm!

07:25.460 --> 07:27.540
Nice, that's the stuff!

07:27.540 --> 07:29.750
You two totally look like a couple!

07:29.750 --> 07:31.040
I'm counting on you!

07:31.040 --> 07:32.880
B-b-bralright!

07:33.080 --> 07:34.960
All I need is that gift certificate.

07:34.960 --> 07:38.000
Then I can finally buy the bra
that I've always dreamed of having!

07:38.000 --> 07:41.000
An essential part of the
lady-like look I want! A real bra!

07:41.330 --> 07:42.420
Yes!

07:42.420 --> 07:44.540
The first step on my road to ideal womanhood!

07:44.540 --> 07:46.290
It all starts with that bra!

07:46.540 --> 07:49.380
Just think of this boyfriend thing
as like working a job!

07:50.130 --> 07:54.290
Bring it on. I'll do whatever it takes
to be able to buy my own bra!

07:54.580 --> 07:56.000
Snuggle up a little closer together.

07:56.000 --> 07:57.080
Bralright!

07:57.710 --> 08:01.290
Gosh, I really can't get over
how cool Ryunosuke is.

08:01.880 --> 08:02.830
Bralright.

08:03.040 --> 08:05.380
Cheeuh! You're killing it!

08:05.500 --> 08:06.540
Bralright!

08:06.880 --> 08:09.920
So hey, how would you feel about
doing a little kiss scene?

08:09.920 --> 08:12.630
C'mon, dude!
That's taking things too damn far!

08:12.630 --> 08:13.580
BRALRIGHT!

08:20.710 --> 08:21.420
<b>SMACK!</b>

08:21.790 --> 08:25.670
Jeez, Ryunosuke! I'm starting to think
that you've actually got the hots for me!

08:25.670 --> 08:27.750
D-dumbass! There's no way in hell!

08:27.750 --> 08:29.540
Stop it! We can't have you fighting!

08:29.540 --> 08:31.170
Aw crap!

08:31.170 --> 08:34.880
I was so gung-ho about buying my first bra
that I got totally carried away!

08:36.380 --> 08:38.540
Well, let's head for the next stop.

08:38.880 --> 08:40.830
Okay! Look over this way!

08:41.000 --> 08:43.580
Aw yeah, that's perfect.
Big smiles now!

08:45.500 --> 08:47.750
You're looking kinda stiff there, Shinobu.

08:47.750 --> 08:49.290
It's making your smile all funky!

08:49.290 --> 08:51.000
W-well, I can't help it...

08:51.000 --> 08:53.710
Hey. Don't start getting the wrong idea.

08:53.710 --> 08:55.790
I just hammed it up
a little much earlier, that's all.

08:55.790 --> 08:57.420
Yeah, I know.

08:57.420 --> 08:58.790
Focus up, you two.

08:58.790 --> 09:00.670
Let's get these pictures done with!

09:00.670 --> 09:01.500
Bralright.

09:01.670 --> 09:03.290
Okay, say cheese!

09:04.420 --> 09:05.880
Who the hell are you?!

09:06.040 --> 09:09.330
<b>SLUUUUUURP</b>

09:10.540 --> 09:11.540
If you must know...

09:11.540 --> 09:13.000
MIND YOUR OWN BEESWAX!

09:15.210 --> 09:16.250
Aw jeez.

09:16.250 --> 09:18.170
Friggin' dumbass. Can't let my
guard down for a second.

09:18.170 --> 09:20.290
Ryunosuke, baby.
You're going about this the wrong way!

09:20.960 --> 09:22.040
A little bird told me.

09:22.040 --> 09:25.040
You're doing this boyfriend bit just so
you can buy a bra, isn't that right?

09:25.040 --> 09:26.330
Yeah, and so what?

09:26.330 --> 09:28.830
C'mon, you don't have to go to
such extremes just for that.

09:29.210 --> 09:32.830
Look! I'll give you this one for free
if you stop all this foolishness.

09:32.830 --> 09:34.580
H-holy crap!

09:34.580 --> 09:36.080
It's a front closure bra.

09:36.080 --> 09:38.920
F-front closure?!

09:39.880 --> 09:42.580
Now you can stop humoring these idiots.

09:42.580 --> 09:44.040
That's not what we agreed on!

09:44.040 --> 09:45.290
We're gonna be screwed if you don't help!

09:45.290 --> 09:46.540
Yeah, what they said!

09:46.830 --> 09:48.380
It's okay, I'll date Shinobu instead!

09:48.380 --> 09:49.580
No, you will not!

09:49.580 --> 09:52.670
Don't be ridiculous!
Everything works out perfectly this way!

09:52.670 --> 09:55.670
NO WAY! ABSOLUTELY NOT!

09:52.920 --> 09:55.670
<b>ZAP</b>

09:52.920 --> 09:55.670
<b>ZAP</b>

09:58.920 --> 10:00.920
Now's our chance. Let's ditch them and go.

10:00.920 --> 10:04.080
You know, it's getting easy to forget that
we're supposed to be the troublemakers here...

10:04.080 --> 10:05.210
Totally.

10:06.960 --> 10:10.130
Okay! Time to shake it off and start anew.

10:10.130 --> 10:11.830
Alrighty, Ryunosuke!

10:11.830 --> 10:14.130
Let's spice things up by having you
give Shinobu a big hug!

10:14.130 --> 10:16.670
Huh?! Doesn't that make it seem kinda forced?

10:16.670 --> 10:18.500
Whatever! It's all staged, anyway!

10:18.500 --> 10:19.710
Just for show!

10:20.460 --> 10:21.670
BRALRIGHT!

10:22.170 --> 10:25.170
Man, she really goes above and beyond
for my requests...

10:26.040 --> 10:27.380
Wow, great stuff!

10:27.380 --> 10:28.670
Okay, say cheese!

10:33.750 --> 10:36.130
Hell yeah! That's just perfect!

10:35.130 --> 10:40.210
<b>CLICK</b>

10:36.130 --> 10:40.210
I just know the bossman will give up
after seeing pics like this!

10:40.380 --> 10:41.630
You okay?

10:41.630 --> 10:42.960
Uh, yeah.

10:42.960 --> 10:44.040
STOP IT!

10:44.630 --> 10:47.380
NO MORE TOUCHY FEELY!
BREAK IT UP, YOU TWO!

10:51.920 --> 10:53.960
Shinobu, my sweet!

10:53.960 --> 10:55.750
I love youuuuuu!

10:55.750 --> 10:56.790
B-Bossman!
You're the love of my life!<b></b>

10:56.790 --> 10:57.960
This is bad!
You're the love of my life!<b></b>

10:57.960 --> 10:59.210
Bossman! You gotta take it easy!

10:59.210 --> 11:00.130
Stop! Stop!

11:02.710 --> 11:04.630
Ah! Not my bra money!

11:04.630 --> 11:06.670
I love youuuuuu!

11:10.380 --> 11:11.750
<b>KAPOW...</b>

11:15.170 --> 11:17.170
S-she gave the bossman a knuckle sandwich!

11:17.170 --> 11:18.960
That's Shinobu for you!

11:18.960 --> 11:20.250
Looks like she handled it.

11:20.250 --> 11:21.250
Now for my bra!

11:21.500 --> 11:22.710
Get back here!

11:22.710 --> 11:25.040
My braaaaaaaaaa!

11:27.420 --> 11:29.630
The fire's still too weak...

11:29.920 --> 11:31.920
Stop! That belongs to me!

11:34.380 --> 11:36.750
Hm. That did the trick.

11:37.040 --> 11:38.170
Goddammit!

11:38.170 --> 11:40.750
NOT MY BRAAAA!

11:41.460 --> 11:42.670
Stay back!

11:44.790 --> 11:47.460
Baby... I'm in love with youuuu!

11:47.460 --> 11:49.330
C'mon bossman! It's time to leave!

11:49.330 --> 11:51.000
It'll never work out! Just trust us!

11:51.000 --> 11:54.080
Nuh-uh! Nuh-uh! Nuh-uh!

11:53.000 --> 11:54.080
<b>NUH-UHHHH!</b>

11:58.330 --> 11:59.630
That's the ticket!

11:59.790 --> 12:00.790
Bossman!

12:01.460 --> 12:02.830
You can have this if we leave!

12:02.830 --> 12:05.250
See? It's one of Shinobu's bras!

12:05.420 --> 12:06.920
Oh! I almost forgot!

12:07.210 --> 12:09.580
S-Shinobu's bra? Like for real?

12:09.580 --> 12:11.000
NO, IT'S NOT!

12:11.000 --> 12:12.460
H-hold on just a second!

12:12.460 --> 12:13.920
Shinobu's actual bra...

12:13.920 --> 12:14.710
AS IF!

12:14.710 --> 12:15.540
All good? Then let's get going!

12:15.540 --> 12:17.170
It's mine! Give that back!

12:17.170 --> 12:18.710
That bra is miiiiiiiine!

12:24.130 --> 12:25.790
What the hell is wrong with you?!

12:25.790 --> 12:27.830
I got Shinobu's bra...
Give that bra back to me right now, dammit!<b></b>

12:27.830 --> 12:28.330
Give that bra back to me right now, dammit!

12:28.330 --> 12:30.880
Spit it out! Come on, fathead!
Spit it out right now!

12:32.750 --> 12:35.580
Hmmm, that's strange.

12:35.580 --> 12:39.580
I wonder where that bra of mine
could have disappeared to...

12:44.330 --> 12:46.920
The whole country will be enjoying
clear skies this evening,

12:46.920 --> 12:49.500
which is the perfect condition
to watch the passing meteor shower.

12:49.500 --> 12:51.290
It's time to dig in!

12:51.290 --> 12:53.250
I hope you all have a good wish in mind

12:53.250 --> 12:55.500
when you catch sight of
a shooting star tonight!

12:55.500 --> 12:57.130
Now for our next story...
Three shumai dumplings per person!<b></b>

12:57.130 --> 12:58.130
Are we clear?

12:58.960 --> 13:00.790
Also, there are no seconds
of the egg drop soup.

13:00.790 --> 13:02.420
So be sure to enjoy every last sip.

13:02.420 --> 13:05.880
Honey, could you please stop making it
sound like we live in poverty at dinner?

13:05.880 --> 13:08.580
Wake up and smell the coffee!
The fact is we are poor!

13:09.710 --> 13:11.750
Take a chill pill.

13:11.750 --> 13:13.880
Just save all your squabbling for...

13:13.880 --> 13:15.880
after dinner. It's embarrassing.

13:16.170 --> 13:17.670
No! My shumai dumplings!

13:17.670 --> 13:19.380
Dammit, Ataru! Why I oughta...!

13:19.380 --> 13:21.580
Didn't you just hear me say
"three per person"?!

13:21.580 --> 13:25.330
If anyone is to blame for us being poor,
it's you for eating us out of house and home!

13:25.330 --> 13:26.630
Have some restrain-

13:29.040 --> 13:31.210
<b>Wish Upon a Star</b>

13:35.750 --> 13:38.000
Congratulations, everyone.

13:38.250 --> 13:41.250
You are this year's big winners.

13:41.880 --> 13:42.750
What?

13:42.750 --> 13:44.630
Who are you supposed to be?

13:44.630 --> 13:47.630
I am a shooting star
that grants people's wishes.

13:47.630 --> 13:49.670
Please call me the Wishing Star.

13:49.670 --> 13:54.540
Your poverty-stricken family has been
chosen to receive a bit of luck this year.

13:55.210 --> 13:57.130
Poverty-stricken?!

13:57.130 --> 14:00.080
I shall grant three wishes of your choosing.

14:00.080 --> 14:01.540
Go on. Whatever you desire.

14:01.540 --> 14:02.710
How rude can you get?!

14:02.710 --> 14:04.290
We aren't some destitute family on the street

14:04.290 --> 14:06.000
that needs to take charity
from a stupid starfish!

14:06.000 --> 14:08.250
Have some manners!
You literally ruined our dinner!

14:08.250 --> 14:10.210
S-stupid starfish?!

14:10.210 --> 14:12.790
Goodness gracious.
The house is such a mess now.

14:12.790 --> 14:14.880
Why does this crap always happen to us?

14:14.880 --> 14:16.040
Back to what you were saying...

14:16.040 --> 14:18.170
Are you really going to
grant us three wishes?

14:18.170 --> 14:19.630
Quit talking with that thing!

14:19.630 --> 14:21.380
It's clearly just a scam!

14:21.380 --> 14:24.670
C'mon, you two need to help out.
Our dinner is all over the place.

14:24.670 --> 14:25.960
Okay.

14:30.920 --> 14:33.080
Well then, I'll just see myself out...

14:33.080 --> 14:34.290
Wait right there!

14:34.290 --> 14:37.790
I hope you realize that it's beyond
inconsiderate of you to just leave like this.

14:37.790 --> 14:38.630
Huh?

14:38.630 --> 14:41.960
He's right. You could at least
help fix up our house first!

14:41.960 --> 14:44.170
Th-that's a fair point.

14:46.790 --> 14:48.210
Here you are, mister.

14:48.210 --> 14:50.920
Please write your wish on
this little star right here.

14:53.380 --> 14:55.170
What's this all about?

14:55.170 --> 14:56.380
Here, it's done.

14:55.170 --> 14:56.380
<b>Return the house to normal</b>

14:56.630 --> 14:58.170
Now just put it right here.

14:58.170 --> 15:00.130
A-are you going to eat it?

15:07.750 --> 15:11.500
Twinkle-twinkle, jingle-jangle, shooting star!

15:11.500 --> 15:14.670
Now please bring this wish to bear!

15:23.000 --> 15:25.790
Now if you'll pardon me.
Sorry for bothering you folks.

15:25.790 --> 15:27.540
HOLD THE PHONE!

15:27.880 --> 15:29.750
Here. Have a drink.

15:30.460 --> 15:34.500
Uh, are you sure about this?
Can I really have some tea?

15:35.420 --> 15:37.250
Why, of course!

15:37.250 --> 15:38.750
Please feel free to take a load off.

15:38.750 --> 15:43.040
Yes! You should have just told us
that you were the real deal at the start!

15:44.630 --> 15:47.830
You fool! Why couldn't you have wished for
a giant pile of money or something?!

15:47.830 --> 15:51.040
Just keep your cool.
We still have two wishes left to work with.

15:51.290 --> 15:52.880
Hook me up with my own harem!

15:52.880 --> 15:55.000
Please cure my darling of
being a serial cheater!

15:55.290 --> 15:56.710
Get out of here with that phony-baloney.

15:56.710 --> 15:57.710
You first, darling!

15:57.710 --> 15:59.170
Just back off, Lum!

15:57.710 --> 15:59.420
<b>I want to eat yakisoba</b>

15:59.170 --> 16:00.460
No way, darling!

16:03.960 --> 16:05.080
Here you go.

16:05.080 --> 16:06.130
Thank you.

16:06.210 --> 16:07.790
<b>KERFLOOOOOM!</b>

16:08.790 --> 16:10.210
Cancel that last wish!

16:10.210 --> 16:13.330
I'm afraid that I'm not able to
accept any cancellations.

16:13.880 --> 16:17.170
<b>Only one left</b>

16:14.330 --> 16:16.880
Uh oh... there's only one wish left.

16:17.630 --> 16:19.670
We're all part of the same family.

16:19.670 --> 16:23.710
Let's discuss this and come up with
a wish that will benefit everyone, okay?

16:23.710 --> 16:25.830
Aw shucks, Mom and Dad!

16:26.580 --> 16:30.710
Don't even worry about me,
just make whatever wish is best for you!

16:30.710 --> 16:32.380
Oh, Ataru...

16:32.380 --> 16:34.290
Bless you, boy.

16:34.290 --> 16:36.210
Right this way, Wishing Star!

16:36.210 --> 16:37.460
You can relax in my room!

16:37.460 --> 16:38.380
Hold it!

16:38.790 --> 16:41.460
And just what do you think you're doing?

16:41.920 --> 16:43.920
Since you two have a lot to discuss,

16:43.920 --> 16:46.460
I'm going to keep our guest here
entertained upstairs.

16:46.460 --> 16:49.420
Why yes, that's a wonderful idea.

16:49.420 --> 16:51.830
But before that, allow me to
hold on to your things.

16:51.830 --> 16:53.130
Oh, thank you.

16:53.500 --> 16:55.670
Can't you have a little faith
in your own son?

16:55.670 --> 16:57.130
I know that look in your eyes, mister!

16:57.130 --> 16:59.920
I've been your mother long enough
to read you like a book!

17:01.380 --> 17:03.250
Nothing gets by her.

17:03.250 --> 17:05.250
What are you doing, darling?

17:06.210 --> 17:07.790
Like you even need to ask!

17:07.790 --> 17:09.250
You're making a fake star, huh?

17:09.250 --> 17:10.330
Shhhh!

17:10.330 --> 17:12.130
Then I'll make one, too!

17:12.130 --> 17:13.580
Too late!

17:12.130 --> 17:13.580
<b>Harem</b>

17:13.670 --> 17:15.040
You snooze, you lose!

17:17.880 --> 17:19.170
It's all ready!

17:20.750 --> 17:22.290
What's the big idea, darling?!

17:22.290 --> 17:24.210
Whatever, you just wanna
hog the wish to yourself!

17:24.210 --> 17:25.920
I'm never letting you get a stupid harem!

17:25.920 --> 17:26.630
Whoa!

17:26.630 --> 17:27.960
Holy crap, look!

17:27.960 --> 17:28.540
Huh?

17:28.540 --> 17:29.170
<b>Harem</b>

17:30.790 --> 17:32.250
DARLIIIIING!

17:34.130 --> 17:36.130
I'm not able to process this wish.

17:36.130 --> 17:37.330
Huh?!

17:38.750 --> 17:41.580
Hmm, this is tough.

17:41.580 --> 17:45.460
It just seems too simplistic for us to
wish for a bunch of cash, you know?

17:45.460 --> 17:47.880
What else could be better for us than money?!

17:47.880 --> 17:50.960
Well, I'm just saying...
we could make a dream come true...

17:50.960 --> 17:52.540
Argh! Stop!

17:52.540 --> 17:56.000
All of your silly dreams or fantasies
can easily be fulfilled with money!

17:56.000 --> 17:57.830
Suppose I can't really argue with that...

17:57.830 --> 17:59.460
Wishing for money is a bad choice!

17:59.460 --> 18:00.290
Huh?

18:00.290 --> 18:02.880
Because that won't cure my darling
of his chronic cheating!

18:02.880 --> 18:07.040
Gotta admit, I'm not sure using the sway of
money to build my harem is the best idea...

18:07.040 --> 18:09.710
Wait a minute!
I thought you waived your right to the wish!

18:09.710 --> 18:12.330
Oh, come on!
This is a family affair and you know it!

18:12.330 --> 18:13.420
Pardon me.

18:13.920 --> 18:16.500
Feel free to take some time
to figure things out.

18:16.500 --> 18:18.460
I can stick around here until dawn.

18:18.460 --> 18:21.290
Oh great! Now we have to deal
with a time limit!

18:21.290 --> 18:23.420
Sure, but that's enough time
to come to a consensus...

18:23.420 --> 18:25.210
Like I said, curing my darling comes first!

18:25.210 --> 18:26.040
Money!

18:26.040 --> 18:27.290
Nope! Rejected!

18:30.250 --> 18:32.920
<b>At this time we conclude our television brodacasting</b>

18:30.250 --> 18:32.920
<b>Have a pleasant night</b>

18:36.670 --> 18:37.630
I say harem!

18:37.630 --> 18:38.880
No, cure my darling!

18:38.880 --> 18:39.960
No, something magical!

18:39.960 --> 18:41.080
No, money!

18:41.380 --> 18:42.790
Pardon me.

18:43.130 --> 18:46.460
I hate to be a bother,
but I'm feeling rather thirsty.

18:46.460 --> 18:50.080
Oh! Please help yourself to
any drink in the kitchen.

18:56.670 --> 18:59.540
She did say I could help myself to anything.

19:00.710 --> 19:02.210
Here's the deal.

19:02.210 --> 19:03.420
We'll decide via lottery.

19:03.420 --> 19:04.540
Seriously?

19:04.540 --> 19:07.000
I mean, all this talking is getting us nowhere!

19:08.210 --> 19:10.960
Oh, come on. None of us expected
a chance like this anyway.

19:10.960 --> 19:14.040
So let's agree to no hard feelings,
no matter who wins!

19:14.040 --> 19:15.330
Okay.
Sounds good.<b></b>

19:16.130 --> 19:17.380
<b>DAD</b>

19:16.130 --> 19:17.380
<b>MOM</b>

19:16.130 --> 19:17.380
<b>LUM</b>

19:16.130 --> 19:17.380
<b>ATARU</b>

19:17.630 --> 19:19.540
Ready? Here we go.

19:19.540 --> 19:20.790
Gulp.

19:26.790 --> 19:28.290
<b>DAD</b>

19:29.040 --> 19:30.790
Yahooooo!

19:31.380 --> 19:32.880
Well, that's that.

19:32.880 --> 19:36.080
But I'm curious, let's see
what exactly Dad wished for.

19:37.290 --> 19:40.250
<b>I want to redo my life</b>

19:38.130 --> 19:40.250
H-honey...?

19:40.960 --> 19:42.580
Oh, I see how it is!

19:42.580 --> 19:44.630
You regret getting married
to me that much, huh?!

19:44.630 --> 19:47.460
N-no! I would never feel that way
about our marriage, dear!

19:47.460 --> 19:48.630
Then what's the deal?

19:48.630 --> 19:51.080
Trying to redo your life because
you regret giving birth to me?!

19:51.080 --> 19:52.290
N-n-no...

19:52.290 --> 19:54.170
Wah! Mommy! This sucks so much!

19:54.170 --> 19:55.290
Oh, Ataru... it's all right. I still care about you.
Wah! Mommy! This sucks so much!<b></b>

19:55.290 --> 19:57.670
Oh, Ataru... it's all right. I still care about you.

19:57.880 --> 19:59.920
Aw, jeez! Don't cry!

19:59.920 --> 20:03.210
Even after your dad divorces me,
I promise that I'll get you through college!

20:03.210 --> 20:06.920
Let's have the Wishing Star give us money,
so we can have fun spending it on ourselves!

20:06.920 --> 20:10.000
At this point, settling for the money
is way more practical!

20:10.290 --> 20:12.130
Oh, Wishing Star!

20:12.130 --> 20:14.750
H-hold on! You can't defy
the sacred results of the lottery!

20:18.420 --> 20:19.580
Hey!
O-oh no!<b></b>

20:19.580 --> 20:20.790
You have to wake up!

20:20.790 --> 20:22.210
Quit snoozing on the job!

20:22.670 --> 20:25.920
Th-that damn star!
It drank every last drop of my beer supply!

20:26.460 --> 20:28.880
Uh oh! The sun is about to come up!

20:29.630 --> 20:30.750
SOMEBODY DO SOMETHING!

20:30.750 --> 20:31.920
COME ON! PLEASE WAKE UP!
SOMEBODY DO SOMETHING!<b></b>

20:31.920 --> 20:32.710
COME ON! PLEASE WAKE UP!

20:32.710 --> 20:34.420
STUPID STAR! WAKE THE HELL UP!

20:38.170 --> 20:38.920
Hey, Wishing Star!

20:38.920 --> 20:40.170
Aw crap! It's still asleep!

20:40.170 --> 20:41.880
Let me handle this!

20:43.130 --> 20:43.960
<b>Wake up</b>

20:44.880 --> 20:46.580
Oh! That's a great idea!

20:46.580 --> 20:48.670
Munch, munch. Gulp.

20:50.880 --> 20:52.710
Oh, thank god!

20:53.540 --> 20:55.380
Welp, that's all of your wishes.

20:56.500 --> 20:59.250
Have a pleasant daaaaaay!

21:04.580 --> 21:06.460
S-say it ain't so...

21:06.460 --> 21:07.580
The money...

21:07.580 --> 21:10.040
My harem...

21:10.040 --> 21:14.170
What good fortune!
You got all three wishes granted in time!

21:14.420 --> 21:15.330
Yep!

21:16.580 --> 21:19.500
It's not enough, I want more love

21:19.500 --> 21:22.500
I can't imagine myself with anyone other than you

21:22.500 --> 21:25.250
So fall for me and look only at me

21:25.250 --> 21:28.250
I already love you even down to your marrow

21:39.420 --> 21:42.420
Deep in those eyes, who are you waiting for?

21:42.420 --> 21:45.380
All you've shown me is your face from the side

21:45.380 --> 21:46.790
I want to know

21:46.790 --> 21:49.130
Give me love, give me love, that's all

21:50.920 --> 21:54.000
Out of every planet it was Earth that I came to

21:54.000 --> 21:56.830
Because your presence drew me to it

21:56.830 --> 21:59.040
I want you to respond, to the vagueness

21:59.040 --> 22:00.130
To I need you

22:00.130 --> 22:01.380
I wanna solve the complication

22:01.380 --> 22:02.920
I want shared love

22:02.920 --> 22:04.580
C'mon c'mon, darling darling

22:04.580 --> 22:05.960
Even if we get separated

22:05.960 --> 22:07.460
C'mon c'mon, darling darling

22:07.460 --> 22:08.750
At the ends of the universe

22:08.750 --> 22:11.250
Just sew the stars and moon together

22:11.250 --> 22:13.250
And draw them close

22:13.250 --> 22:14.210
After all

22:14.210 --> 22:16.920
It's not enough, I want more love

22:16.920 --> 22:19.880
I can't imagine myself with anyone other than you

22:19.880 --> 22:22.710
So fall for me and look only at me

22:22.710 --> 22:25.540
I already love you even down to your marrow

22:25.540 --> 22:28.460
No way no way, don't run off somewhere

22:28.460 --> 22:31.290
I want to revolve around the planet known as you

22:31.290 --> 22:34.210
Hey look this way, then look that way

22:34.210 --> 22:37.330
In spite of everything, I'm just so in love with you

22:37.540 --> 22:39.000
Absolutely, absolutely

22:39.000 --> 22:40.380
I'll give you a shock

22:40.380 --> 22:41.920
Enough, enough

22:41.920 --> 22:43.330
Not enough love

22:46.040 --> 22:50.960
<b>Indelible Lipstick Magic!!</b>

22:46.040 --> 22:50.960
<b>Lethal Attacks: Yaminabe!</b>

22:46.290 --> 22:48.130
On the next episode of "Urusei Yatsura"!

22:48.130 --> 22:50.630
Is that some lipstick?!
